window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-029-a4f49f87138ccc12.json"]={sha256:"a4f49f87138ccc1285c6d9dfd5363d90788a57f682c19d9b19fd24a435279b48",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-931f803098f1b483","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/timestamping.html","title":"Timestamping","titleEn":"Timestamping","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-029","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-029","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-030","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core/blob/master/infiniband-diags/man/perfquery.8.in.rst"],"title":"InfiniBand perfquery：四位元組單位與聚合邊界","titleEn":"InfiniBand perfquery: four-byte units and aggregation boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付時鐘來源表、兩組區間、跨零案例與延遲聲明的可證明條件；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver clock provenance, both uncertainty intervals, the zero-crossing case and the conditions supporting a latency claim. Preserve measurement uncertainty rather than reporting additional meaningless decimal places. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立欄位字典，逐項列 raw_unit、multiplier、direction 與 scope；不依欄位名稱猜單位。","differenceEn":"Build a field dictionary specifying raw unit, multiplier, direction and scope. Require an explicit definition for each selected field instead of guessing units from a familiar-looking name.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["若觀察差值 d、兩時鐘差的絕對誤差界 e，真實延遲位於 [d-e,d+e]；負下界表示無法辨識正延遲而非真的逆時；觀察單向差值 10 微秒；相對時鐘誤差界由 2 增為 8 微秒；數值檢查計算下界；名義式 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound；變更式 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","本課指定 PortXmitData 增量乘四得到位元組，再除時間與 1000000 得 decimal MB/s；不套用到所有計數器；單埠增量 1000000 counter units，觀測時間由 2 改為 4 秒；計數器未重置且觀察方向固定；名義式 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s；變更式 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For observed difference d and a bound e on relative clock error, true latency lies between d-e and d+e. A negative lower bound signals insufficient timing certainty, not backward packet travel. Observe a 10-microsecond timestamp difference. Relative clock uncertainty changes from 2 to 8 microseconds; the numeric checks calculate the lower endpoint, with upper endpoints retained in the evidence table. Nominal 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound; changed 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For the specified PortXmitData counter, multiply increments by four, divide by elapsed seconds and then by one million for decimal MB/s. Do not apply that multiplier indiscriminately to every counter field. A single port increases by 1000000 counter units. Observation duration changes from 2 to 4 seconds, with no reset and unchanged transmit direction. This is a synthetic interval, not a fabric measurement. Nominal 1000000*4/2/1000000 = 2 MB/s; changed 1000000*4/4/1000000 = 1 MB/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-039","referenceUrls":["https://openzfs.github.io/openzfs-docs/Basic%20Concepts/Operations/Scrub%20and%20Resilver.html"],"title":"OpenZFS：重建完成與 checksum 覆蓋的不同證據","titleEn":"OpenZFS: reconstruction completion versus checksum coverage","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付時鐘來源表、兩組區間、跨零案例與延遲聲明的可證明條件；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver clock provenance, both uncertainty intervals, the zero-crossing case and the conditions supporting a latency claim. Preserve measurement uncertainty rather than reporting additional meaningless decimal places. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"分開 copied_ranges、verified_ranges 與 failed_ranges，將半開區間做聯集；進度報表不可使用單一 completed 欄位。","differenceEn":"Keep copied, verified and failed ranges separately and union half-open intervals. Avoid one ambiguous completed field; the report must state which operation completed for which part of the target.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["若觀察差值 d、兩時鐘差的絕對誤差界 e，真實延遲位於 [d-e,d+e]；負下界表示無法辨識正延遲而非真的逆時；觀察單向差值 10 微秒；相對時鐘誤差界由 2 增為 8 微秒；數值檢查計算下界；名義式 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound；變更式 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","驗證覆蓋率是已完成 checksum 檢查的獨特位元組除本次目標範圍；重複掃描同一範圍不能增加覆蓋；目標 100 GiB 且已全部重建；名義 checksum 覆蓋 40 GiB，變更 100 GiB；不存在未解決的 checksum 錯誤；名義式 40/100*100 = 40 % verified coverage；變更式 100/100*100 = 100 % verified coverage。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For observed difference d and a bound e on relative clock error, true latency lies between d-e and d+e. A negative lower bound signals insufficient timing certainty, not backward packet travel. Observe a 10-microsecond timestamp difference. Relative clock uncertainty changes from 2 to 8 microseconds; the numeric checks calculate the lower endpoint, with upper endpoints retained in the evidence table. Nominal 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound; changed 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Verification coverage is unique target bytes whose checksum checks completed divided by the target range. Repeated scans of the same range do not increase coverage, even if total I/O counters grow. The target is 100 GiB and reconstruction is complete in both cases. Checksum coverage changes from 40 to 100 GiB, with no unresolved checksum failures in the covered portions. Nominal 40/100*100 = 40 % verified coverage; changed 100/100*100 = 100 % verified coverage. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b7c409273267b461","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core/blob/master/infiniband-diags/man/perfquery.8.in.rst","title":"perfquery source and manual","titleEn":"perfquery source and manual","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-9406619b083fe9e7","url":"https://openzfs.github.io/openzfs-docs/Basic%20Concepts/Operations/Scrub%20and%20Resilver.html","title":"Scrub and Resilver","titleEn":"Scrub and Resilver","publisher":"OpenZFS project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
